<title>USA: Bradley Real Estate sells Illinois mall.</title>
<headline>Bradley Real Estate sells Illinois mall.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradley Real Estate Inc said Tuesday it sold Meadows Town Mall, in Rolling Meadows, Ill. for $6.1 million cash.</p>
<p>Bradley intends to reinvest the proceeds into targeted acquisitions which focus on grocery-anchored open-air shopping centers in the upper U.S. Midwest.</p>
<p>Bradley is a real estate investment trust which owns and operates neighborhood and community centers located in the Midwest region of the United States.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
